  "details": "Hi! Seeing so much chaos when a host of a room desperately trying to invite and kick certain players, ive come up with the idea of multi host room. The main host of the room can give their desired player(s) privileges to become a moderatator-like role for the room. They have privilege to kick or invite people (with the main host's consent of course) so it would be less chaotic for the main host. I hope this idea is considerable!",
